{
  "type": "minecraft:notice",
  "title": "Advancements",
  "external_title": "Advancements",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "Advancements",
        "bold": true,
        "color": "dark_green"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": [
        {
          "text": "",
          "bold": false,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        {
          "text": "Custom Advancements",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Pandamium adds many custom advancements to the vanilla advancement trees.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "These advancements are inspired by the legacy achievements from older versions of Minecraft.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "They provide additional challenges to complete while playing and are intended to bring some nostalgia to longtime Minecraft players.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Additionally, Pandamium has a new advancement tree called Pandamium.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "There you will find advancements related to custom pandamium features.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "If one cannot be obtained anymore it will be moved to a Legacy Pandamium advancement tree.",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Advancement Help",
          "bold": true,
          "color": "gold"
        },
        "\n\n",
        {
          "text": "Use ",
          "color": "gray"
        },
        {
          "text": "/trigger help.advancements",
          "color": "aqua"
        },
        {
          "text": " to see your progress on all the advancement with multiple requirements.",
          "color": "gray"
        }
      ],
      "width": 500
    },
    {
      "type": "minecraft:plain_message",
      "contents": {
        "text": "                                                      ",
        "underlined": true,
        "color": "white"
      },
      "width": 500
    }
  ],
  "can_close_with_escape": true,
  "pause": false,
  "after_action": "none",
  "action": {
    "label": {
      "translate": "gui.back"
    },
    "action": {
      "type": "minecraft:run_command",
      "command": "trigger help set 8"
    }
  }
}